[[Open This|Rehost Assessment]]

---

Identify workloads for migration and ensure they are compatible with the cloud provider's environment.

* ''Document the current setup'': OS version, CPU/RAM/disk usage (use tools like Windows Performance Monitor or cloud assessment tools).
* ''Identify dependencies'': SQL Server instance, any file shares, network ports, hardcoded hostnames/IPs, licenses, and external integrations.
* Check for issues like hostname dependencies (common in Windows apps) or reliance on specific hardware.

See: [[Aim Server]]